m was to provide a quality service for users.","category":"cause","label":"F0","evidence":"We were initially asked to deliver the service in a matter of weeks, which put huge pressure on everyone and we quickly discovered would not be possible if we wanted to create a quality service for our users.","narrative":"de aanvankelijk gevraagde levering binnen enkele weken werd niet haalbaar geacht met behoud van een kwalitatieve gebruikersdienst","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The content accurately preserves both the initial deadline and the stated quality constraint.","materiality":"Material context for the development timeline."},{"excerpt":"De werkwijze begon met de ervaring van aanvragers: die werd eerst naar alpha gebracht.","claim":"The team began by focusing on the applicants’ experience and took that work to alpha first.","category":"chronology","label":"F0","evidence":"My team focused on the users applying for refunds first and this is what we took to the alpha assessment.","narrative":"eerst de aanvragerservaring uitwerken","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"“Applicants’ experience” summarizes the source’s focus on users applying for refunds; the order and alpha milestone match.","materiality":"Material to the described user-group sequencing."},{"excerpt":"Plannen voor caseworkers kwamen later.","claim":"Plans for caseworker users came later than the initial work focused on applicants.","category":"chronology","label":"F0","evidence":"Plans for the caseworker user came later.","narrative":"later caseworkerwerk toevoegen","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The statement matches the source.","materiality":"Material to the described user-group sequencing."},{"excerpt":"Tijdens de private beta wisselden tweewekelijkse sprints af tussen aanvragen aannemen en tijd besteden aan testen, onderzoek en verwerking.","claim":"During private beta, the team alternated fortni